After the fix, a repo-wide grep finds no `WorkOrderId` in code. The only remaining mentions are in CHANGELOG.md and docs/migration.md, which describe the old name on purpose, so I left them. Other identifiers that contain "WorkOrder", such as `WorkOrderState` and `workOrderIdFor`, are separate names outside this rename, so I left them too.

`tsc --noEmit` is clean and `bun test` passes (86 pass, 0 fail)."}

